{"screen_name": "yamama_iro", "file": "yamama_iro-c8c676", "name": "やまぶき", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2003463305294409728/4YOltFun.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1400016222368854016/1760947059/1500x500", "description": "絵描き/Vtuber好き/原神、スタレ、ゼンゼロ、鳴潮 好き/ハムスター好き/フォロバは気まぐれ。只今依頼受付中。ご相談、依頼ははDMへ\nskeb→http://skeb.jp/@yamama_iro", "total_works": 10, "scraped_works": 10, "first_seen": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-18T10:41:03.434823+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 5000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 5000, "max": 5000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/yamama_iro", "name": "yamama_iro"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://lit.link/yamabukiiro", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/7451864", "name": "7451864"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@yamama_iro/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d75c2bf/uploads/origins/e45b3639-fe26-4a51-be65-c58f6928d853?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7060128359d1c9420c4a33c1f8cec11", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d75c2bf/uploads/origins/e45b3639-fe26-4a51-be65-c58f6928d853?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7060128359d1c9420c4a33c1f8cec11, https://si.imgix.net/6d75c2bf/uploads/origins/e45b3639-fe26-4a51-be65-c58f6928d853?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1f02d315c46b222e3a62bff636add3c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d75c2bf/uploads/origins/e45b3639-fe26-4a51-be65-c58f6928d853?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3678cfdb8df5c2e141c7e4d844d04362 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I absolutely love your art style and would love to request an illustration of my VTuber character! She's a cat god streaming in a bright, colorful post-apocalyptic world inspired by “Zom100” and “Words Bubble Up Like Soda Water!” I'll leave the pose and composition to you. Pack it full of cute decora and yamikawaii design elements—cute eyeballs, cats, bells, confetti, candy, colorful blood, etc.! \n\nPersonality is spoiled and a bit bratty, but still adorable! A mix of horror and cuteness!! \n\nThanks for checking out the design! <33 \n\nIf possible, please also provide a .psd file, or versions with and without the background! This will be used on my streams and SNS.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hM3K2_PMZAXTonVE9xbgp7zp8Km6FlTx", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamama_iro/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f63de2/uploads/origins/5f980a67-6787-4abf-85f8-e24d538f89df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b6085441efe0cfa27486c8fde4632d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f63de2/uploads/origins/5f980a67-6787-4abf-85f8-e24d538f89df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b6085441efe0cfa27486c8fde4632d9, https://si.imgix.net/e1f63de2/uploads/origins/5f980a67-6787-4abf-85f8-e24d538f89df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=251b833bc3a69e6784b14ff176be967b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1f63de2/uploads/origins/5f980a67-6787-4abf-85f8-e24d538f89df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80b78f5a2f3ed601131f20de3f38a31c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "やまぶき様\n初めまして。\nVtuber活動をしております、虹音《Rain》と申します。\n\n今回は私の等身イラストをお願いしたいです！\n構図や背景などはやまぶき様にお任せしたく、お好きなように描いていただきたいです！\n衣装や装飾、髪型等の大きな変更、捏造も問題ありません\n\n【使用用途】\n・Youtube、Twitterでのサムネイルなどでの使用\n・リスナーさんへお礼用のグッズ作成(収益は出ませんが販売といった形になります)\n\n可能な範囲で描いていただければ幸いです。こちらの内容で難しければお断り頂いても構いません…！！\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Za0RTFdFjECLdVa7zqBocAfIi95HPIsU?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamama_iro/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc1b3da3/uploads/origins/4765225e-69a5-40ca-91a7-4c9b911b6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a3854a21e1c7cedf362d6a9e7c2555d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cc1b3da3/uploads/origins/4765225e-69a5-40ca-91a7-4c9b911b6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a3854a21e1c7cedf362d6a9e7c2555d, https://si.imgix.net/cc1b3da3/uploads/origins/4765225e-69a5-40ca-91a7-4c9b911b6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e1283ba2c0367e835055e924fbb2f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cc1b3da3/uploads/origins/4765225e-69a5-40ca-91a7-4c9b911b6695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3485135c317a0ebcbea86f5181395bff 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リクエストの送信失礼します……！\nやまぶきさまの描かれる、鮮やかでぱっと目をひくイラストが大好きです！！描かれるお顔の造形もとても好きで……💞\n\nもしご都合よろしければ、オリジナルキャラクターを描いていただけないでしょうか……！ゲーム好きの高校生、明るくお兄ちゃん気質な性格です。  表情や構図など全てお任せします。  ご検討いただけますと嬉しいです。 よろしくお願いします……！  \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1rOg5XDyWu3GKoz1YBqtwKurUC_hcuwJj/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n【使用可能性のある用途】\nアイコン、ヘッダー\n描いていただいたものとしてSNS等に投稿\n(いずれも個人使用の範囲を守ります！)\n\nご検討いただけますと嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします……！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamama_iro/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/31b747ba/uploads/origins/4104dfad-ea18-424c-87b5-f73640d61d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0259628f6d0f0bc970c082ba4422540", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31b747ba/uploads/origins/4104dfad-ea18-424c-87b5-f73640d61d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0259628f6d0f0bc970c082ba4422540, https://si.imgix.net/31b747ba/uploads/origins/4104dfad-ea18-424c-87b5-f73640d61d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65e31cfeea6e7537418ef81d419b8c6b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31b747ba/uploads/origins/4104dfad-ea18-424c-87b5-f73640d61d49?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c13e611dabb179dd16bae03d34c97836 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもお世話になっております！\n”大好物のクッキーに埋もれるniobi.(犬)”をリクエストしたいです。\n資料は下記アカウントのアイコンの白い犬となります。\n宜しければ描いていただけると嬉しいです！\n※イラストのデータ形式は特に指定はありません。\n\nhttps://x.com/ironiob", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamama_iro/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf8ac6e0/uploads/origins/74d0a8f9-41c6-4bca-a4c0-4b90385ded44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67ff5d1a1af12c3ace7107fbf1e15ff4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf8ac6e0/uploads/origins/74d0a8f9-41c6-4bca-a4c0-4b90385ded44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67ff5d1a1af12c3ace7107fbf1e15ff4, https://si.imgix.net/bf8ac6e0/uploads/origins/74d0a8f9-41c6-4bca-a4c0-4b90385ded44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=822ca11c7d4b78f52cbdc5279a6b86bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf8ac6e0/uploads/origins/74d0a8f9-41c6-4bca-a4c0-4b90385ded44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab3d0d5fa53f7c362ba415585b17023a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "夏っぽい服装のゆちをお願いしまふ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamama_iro/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/934211d0/uploads/origins/cd8d05d6-5140-4002-abb8-8add607616cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dee8c808ae3b36090cdc999fdac367b3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/934211d0/uploads/origins/cd8d05d6-5140-4002-abb8-8add607616cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dee8c808ae3b36090cdc999fdac367b3, https://si.imgix.net/934211d0/uploads/origins/cd8d05d6-5140-4002-abb8-8add607616cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bbe4633f68689be69fe259a1a5